              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ljqin12"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The family loved this recipe ot reminds me of a coca cola wing recipe. I doubled the recipe and marinated the chicken in a ziplock. The last 30 mins, i cranked the oven to 400 and added cornstarch to the juice.",
            "datePublished": "2020-11-21T05:22:09.680Z"
