              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mjb36"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I cant believe these don't have more stars! They were wonderful. I cooked the wings in my fry daddy for 12 mins before I soaked them in the marinade for 10 mins. Then I cooked them in the marinade for 10 mins at 425 degrees. Very tastey!",
            "datePublished": "2012-03-29T17:59:24.610Z"
          },
          {
